# ============================================================
# worker/ - Git ignore
# ============================================================

# Go build artifacts
# 坑: 之前写 `worker` 会递归匹配, 把 `worker/cmd/worker/` 整个 ignore 掉,
# 导致 main.go 一直进不了 git. 改成具体路径 `worker/worker` + `worker.exe` 只 ignore 根下的 binary.
worker/worker
worker.exe
*.exe
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib

# Go test
*.test
*.out
coverage.txt
coverage.html

# Go workspace
go.work
go.work.sum

# IDE
.idea/
.vscode/
*.iml
*.swp

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
